# GoLic ignore file -- https://github.com/Bugs5382/golic
# Deny everything, then allow the source extensions golic should header.
*
# Recurse into subdirectories (so the package source is reached).
!*/
# ...inject into Python sources:
!*.py
# Never virtualenvs, build output, caches, or generated docs:
.venv/**
venv/**
dist/**
build/**
**/__pycache__/**
docs/**
